{
  "title": "Modified context theme to remember the chosen theme",
  "context": [
    "A shopper who switched the storefront to the dark theme got the light theme back after every reload. The storefront now stores the chosen theme in the browser each time a shopper switches it, and starts in the stored theme when it loads.",
    "",
    "## Overview",
    "",
    "- **When** a shopper clicks \"Switch theme\", **then** [the browser stores the new theme, `dark` or `light`, under `theme`](code:src/App.vue#L11).",
    "- **When** a shopper reloads a page after choosing the dark theme, **then** [the page starts in the dark theme](code:src/App.vue#L8).",
    "- **When** a shopper opens the storefront for the first time, **then** nothing changes: the page starts in the light theme.",
    "",
    "## Implementation",
    "",
    "**`src/App.vue`**",
    "",
    "- Modified [`theme`](code:src/App.vue#L8) to start as `\"dark\"` when `localStorage.getItem(\"theme\")` returns `\"dark\"`, and as `\"light\"` for `null` and for every other value. It started as `\"light\"` before.",
    "- Modified `toggleTheme` to [call `localStorage.setItem()` with `\"theme\"` and the new value of `theme`](code:src/App.vue#L11), after it switches `theme`."
  ],
  "diff": [
    "diff --git a/src/App.vue b/src/App.vue",
    "--- a/src/App.vue",
    "+++ b/src/App.vue",
    "@@ -8 +8 @@ import { themeKey, type Theme } from \"@/components/theme\"",
    "-const theme = ref<Theme>(\"light\")",
    "+const theme = ref<Theme>(localStorage.getItem(\"theme\") === \"dark\" ? \"dark\" : \"light\")",
    "@@ -10,0 +11 @@ const toggleTheme = () => {",
    "+  localStorage.setItem(\"theme\", theme.value)"
  ],
